[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the retaining bolts.</p><p>2. Release the fixing buttons using the special tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Remove the tailgate internal panel.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047075.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the tailgate internal\npanel and secure it using the special fixing buttons.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p>"]]